# Third-Party Notices & Legal Compliance

## Compliance Statement

`tvos-cobalt-userscript` is an independent open-source binary patching tool written from scratch
for educational, interoperability, and personal customization purposes.

- This repository contains **zero** copyrighted code, binaries, `.ipa` packages, icons, artwork,
  or FairPlay decryption keys belonging to Apple Inc., Google LLC, or YouTube.
- Users must legally obtain their own `.ipa` package through their own Apple Account and supply
  it locally at patch time.
- Any icon customization (`--invert-icon`) operates strictly on the user's own local `.ipa` at
  build time and does not ship any third-party visual assets.

